// Matching (`level reads …`): how far a pattern reads a text (wholly, to a statement's end, else as far as it does;
// none when a literal of it is not in the text); holes bound; a span; a text read as a type; what a node's keys read a
// text wholly as; the last of a list; what a node reads with (`with`); whether a closure reads at a place now; what the
// rules around a context led by the text at a place read there (the rules' lead bytes first), and the two caches of it.
